      "body": "RD-N proper -> seedUniv' BUILD: landed 2a (concrete chart-level N z + ann->hdvd bridge, reusable finiteness) + the concrete seedUniv' + isGenerator_seedUniv' GATED on RD-N (SeedUnivRDN) + hfib. RD-N proper (z not-in supp) itself NOT closed -- the remaining geometric wall (I-0302 2b/2c), now precisely reduced and threaded as the hypothesis seedUniv' consumes. Both files single-module LEAN_NUM_THREADS=1 lake build GREEN under the mkdir lock (RDNChart 10s / SeedUniv 288s, 8789/8798 jobs). All keystones lean_verify axiom-clean [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]; zero sorries; zero warnings in my files. Root: HEAD-blob + only my import line each (protocol 4); sibling PicEtCrossBaseGraph add + RDN/Achiever/FibreCut/Seed/UnivFibreHinj working-tree removals NOT swept; show --stat = my paths + root +1.\n\n=== COMMITS (this lane) ===\n- afede9ef5  DD-4 redesign RD-N step 2a: concrete chart-level colength N z + ann->hdvd bridge. New file Picard/DivSchemeRedesignRDNChart.lean (186 L).\n- 64f1c02a2  DD-4 redesign: concrete seedUniv' + isGenerator_seedUniv' (gated on RD-N). New file Picard/DivSchemeRedesignSeedUniv.lean (228 L).\n\n=== KEYSTONES (VERBATIM) ===\n\n(REUSABLE FINITENESS, mathlib-only, Picard/DivSchemeRedesignRDNChart.lean)\ntheorem Module.Finite.span_range_of_finite_isScalarTower {R S M N : Type*} [CommRing R] [CommRing S] [Algebra R S] [AddCommGroup M] [Module R M] [Module.Finite R M] [AddCommGroup N] [Module R N] [Module S N] [IsScalarTower R S N] (f : M ->l[R] N) : Module.Finite S (Submodule.span S (Set.range f))\n\n(THE CONCRETE N z, ns AlgebraicGeometry.ThetaGeneratorSeed)\nnoncomputable def chartColengthModule (K : Submodule R (relThetaSections C R pi a)) (b : Bool) (s : relThetaSections C R pi a) : Submodule Gamma(V) (Gamma(V) / Ideal.span {relThetaResSide a b le_rfl s}) := Submodule.span _ (Set.range ((Ideal.Quotient.mka R (Ideal.span {relThetaResSide a b le_rfl s})).toLinearMap.comp (chartReadMap K b)))    [V = relPinnedChart C R pi b]\nchartColengthModule_finite : Module.Finite Gamma(V) (chartColengthModule K b s)   [via the finiteness keystone, K finite over R]\n\n(THE ann->hdvd BRIDGE)\ntheorem forall_mul_read_mem_span_of_forall_smul_eq_zero (K)(b)(s) {h : Gamma(V)} (hann : forall n : (chartColengthModule K b s), h . n = 0) : forall psi in K, h * relThetaResSide a b le_rfl psi in Ideal.span {relThetaResSide a b le_rfl s}\n\n(THE ann-cutter SEED-SHAPED, from RD-N)\ntheorem exists_h_mem_basicOpen_forall_mul_read_mem_span (K)(b)(s)[Module.Finite R K] {z} (hz : z in relPinnedChart C R pi b) (hsupp : (isAffineOpen_relPinnedChart C R pi b).primeIdealOf <z,hz> not-in Module.support Gamma(V) (chartColengthModule K b s)) : exists h : Gamma(V), z in (relCurve C R).basicOpen h and (forall psi in K, h * relThetaResSide a b le_rfl psi in Ideal.span {relThetaResSide a b le_rfl s})\n\n(THE CONCRETE seedUniv', ns AlgebraicGeometry.ThetaGeneratorSeed, Picard/DivSchemeRedesignSeedUniv.lean)\nnoncomputable def seedUniv' (hrdn : SeedUnivRDN C hpi g r1 r2 b1 b2 i j hO hchi) : ThetaGeneratorSeed C (seedChartRing ...) pi (windowM_choice pi hpi g) (divUniversalSeedK ...)   -- side/sec/sec_mem := landed seedUniv's (relative achiever); h := ann-based fibre-cutter from RD-N (exists_seedUniv'_h).\n\n(THE REDESIGNED FINALE)\ntheorem isGenerator_seedUniv' (hrdn : SeedUnivRDN ...) (hfib : <the isGenerator_of_ann_cutter hfib for seedUniv' hrdn>) : (seedUniv' ... hrdn).IsGenerator := isGenerator_of_ann_cutter (seedUniv' ... hrdn) (fun z _psi hpsi => (exists_seedUniv'_h ... hrdn z).choose_spec.2 hpsi) hfib   -- DIRECT hdvd (hann) DISCHARGED from the ann-cutter via the 2a bridge; hfib threaded.\n\n=== WHAT LANDED vs RESIDUAL ===\nLANDED: 2a (concrete N z over Gamma(V) + Module.Finite + ann->hdvd bridge + ann-cutter existence, all reusable); seedUniv' VALUE (I-0292 residual 1); isGenerator_seedUniv' reduced to exactly two honest inputs -- SeedUnivRDN (RD-N) and hfib -- with hann DISCHARGED (not threaded).\n\nRESIDUAL = RD-N proper (close SeedUnivRDN), the I-0302 2b/2c wall, now precisely reduced:\n  SeedUnivRDN z := primeIdealOf z not-in Module.support Gamma(V) (seedUnivColength z);  seedUnivColength z := chartColengthModule divUniversalSeedK (seedUniv.side z) (seedUniv.sec z).\n  (2b) Subsingleton(kappa(p) tensor N z) via subsingleton_tmul_residueField_of_flat_quotient (RelDivisor:303, LANDED) fed by (i) flat_chart_colength_divUniversalSeedK (683de581f, chart J-flat over R_Z gated on hchi) and (ii) the achiever field-vanishing read(sec z) tensor 1 = 0 from ..._achieves_seedPrime coeffAt=baseDivisorAt (I-0291) -- the genuine XL content (achiever d_p divisibility wiring).\n  (2c) stalk bridge: primeIdealOf z (of Gamma(V)) not-in support  <-  germ_z(read psi) in <germ_z(read s)>  via Module.notMem_support_iff + LocalizedModule.subsingleton_iff + hV.isLocalization_stalk (generators localize to 0; clear denominators from germ membership). The germ membership is produced by the LANDED mem_span_singleton_map_of_subsingleton_tmul_residueField_localRing (RelDivisor:241, phi := germ_z) fed by (2b).\n  hfib: the achiever's fibrewise-nonzero reading on the cutter neighbourhood (analogue of seedUniv_hfib with the ann-cutter in the premise; NOT dischargeable from seedUniv_hfib -- that needs h=algebraMap f). Threaded for now; the honest \"no-leak\" fact.\n\n=== DOWNSTREAM (certificate + U1) ===\nOnce SeedUnivRDN + hfib discharged, isGenerator_seedUniv' is unconditional bar hchi/hO -> certificate (non-circular, dvd holds) -> divUniversalFamily := divFamEps_certifiedFamily (DDR9-U U1) -> divRep. Anti-circularity preserved: certificate-FREE, IsCertified-FREE; order flat(landed)->RD-N(gated)->seedUniv'(here)->isGenerator(here)->certificate->U1.",
