      "body": "redesign brick 1 J-flat BUILD \u2014 the (c4) reading-map cokernel R_Z-flatness exposed as a reusable keystone, reduced to the single carve input; genuine hspan_seedUniv (carve wiring at seedUniv) is the precisely-scoped residual (gated on redesigned seedUniv bricks 2-4 + the section->functionField germ bridge).\n\nNew file Picard/DivSchemeRedesignJFlat.lean (175 L). Single-module LEAN_NUM_THREADS=1 lake build GREEN under the mkdir lock (8672 jobs, 16s). All 3 keystones lean_verify axiom-clean [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]; zero sorries; zero new warnings (Pic.lean show-style + Challenge.lean sorries are pre-existing). Full-root stays green (leaf file). Root: HEAD-blob + own line only (sibling PicEtCrossBaseGraph line + Hinj-removal in working tree NOT swept; show --stat = my 2 paths, root +1).\n\n=== COMMIT (this lane) ===\n- f033986c8  brick 1 J-flat: expose (c4) reading-map cokernel R_Z-flatness as a reusable keystone, reduced to the carve input\n\n=== KEYSTONES (VERBATIM; namespace AlgebraicGeometry.ThetaGeneratorSeed; section vars {k C R} {pi a} {K}, (D : ThetaGeneratorSeed C R pi a K); colength z := Gamma(relCurve C R, D.piece z) / Ideal.span {D.eqn z}; N z := D.sideColengthSubmodule z) ===\n\n(1) THE flat producer downstream RD-N (\u00a71.3 input iii 'J z R_Z-flat') + certificate consume:\n  forall_flat_colength_quotient_of_hsub (D) [Module.Finite R K]\n    (hcolFin : forall z, Module.Finite R (colength z))\n    (hcolFlat : forall z, Module.Flat R (colength z))\n    (hsub : forall (z : relCurve C R) (p : PrimeSpectrum R),\n      Function.Injective ((D.sideColengthSubmodule z).subtype.rTensor p.asIdeal.ResidueField))\n    : forall z, Module.Flat R (colength z / D.sideColengthSubmodule z)\n  \u2014 hsub = the SINGLE genuine carve obligation: fibre non-collapse N z (x) kappa(p) into colength z (x) kappa(p) (rank-g pinning from divUniversal_carve_residueField). Composes landed hsub=>hinj (hinj_of_forall_sideColengthSubmodule_subtype_rTensor_injective, I-0286) + hinj=>hspan (hspan_of_forall_liftQ_rTensor_injective, I-0282) + c4.\n\n(2) forall_flat_colength_quotient_of_hspan (D) [Module.Finite R K] (hcolFin)(hcolFlat)\n    (hspan : forall (z)(p : PrimeSpectrum R),\n      LinearMap.ker (((D.kColengthMap z).comp K.subtype).rTensor p.asIdeal.ResidueField)\n        <= LinearMap.range ((LinearMap.ker ((D.kColengthMap z).comp K.subtype)).subtype.rTensor p.asIdeal.ResidueField))\n    : forall z, Module.Flat R (colength z / D.sideColengthSubmodule z)\n  \u2014 exact hflat argument of dvd_of_flat_quotient_of_field_vanishing (SeedDvd:128); hspan = the c4 (SlicingFlatKernel:296) hypothesis at L = ker f_z, hle = le_rfl.\n\n(3) flat_colength_quotient_of_hspan (D) (z) [Module.Finite R K] [Module.Finite R (colength z)] [Module.Flat R (colength z)] (hspan_z) : Module.Flat R (colength z / D.sideColengthSubmodule z)  \u2014 single-point c4 wrapper.\n\n=== WHAT THIS IS ===\ncolength z / N z ~= Gamma(D(h z)) / J.Gamma(D(h z)) (piecewise Gamma/J; eqn z = read(sec z) in J) \u2014 the c4 conclusion of spec \u00a71.4. From this the base ideal J itself is R_Z-flat as ker(Gamma -> Gamma/J) (Gamma flat, Gamma/J flat via SES) \u2014 a cheap downstream step, NOT yet added here. Sound fibrewise-spanning route: NEVER the false FibreInjective (f_z (x) kappa always kills the seed section); the hspan/hsub route divides ker out first.\n\n=== RESIDUAL \u2014 hsub_seedUniv (the genuine XL carve wall, UNCHANGED difficulty) ===\nhsub at the concrete redesigned seedUniv: Function.Injective ((sideColengthSubmodule z).subtype.rTensor kappa(p)) via divUniversal_carve_residueField (FamilyUniv:135, carvePairArrow=0) transported by ker_baseChange_mkQ (DivCarveKit:91) + divUniversalFibreKM_eq_span (Res:376) + corank-g finrank_divUniversalFibreKM_add (AssembleKappa:207). BLOCKER = the still-UNBUILT section->functionField germ bridge (relThetaResSide on D(h') <-> thetaFieldRead) identifying the piece colength fibre with the fibre-window reading (I-0286), which depends on the redesigned (sec z, h z) of bricks 2-4. This file takes hsub/hspan as HYPOTHESES so the flat conclusion is non-circular and stable under that redesign; the carve wiring instantiates them downstream. No FibreInjective (dead). No sorries; full-root green.",
