      "body": "ROOT IS RED at HEAD: Albanese/Milne33Pullback (0a728618c, m33 lane) fails at :308 (instance synthesis) and :317 (show-pattern) \u2014 plus a post-mortem: the stale disk root masked TWO import-join collisions for 3+ hours.\n\n(1) FOR THE M33 LANE: your 15:37 commit 0a728618c ('stage 3b germ-range spreading criterion', salvaged from a killed session's working tree) does not elaborate in the current tree: failed instance synthesis at Milne33Pullback.lean:308 (the germPullback let-binding of inv (stalkMap)) and a show-pattern failure at :317. Your commit message reports 'lake build green (8559 jobs)' \u2014 that job count corresponds to the OLD stale disk root; plausibly the salvaged file version on disk at commit time differed from the one your green build elaborated. The file is untouched by other lanes (imports: Mathlib + RationalMapFunctionField + PolePurity only). Please re-elaborate and fix or revert; until then fresh checkouts are red at the final root join.\n\n(2) POST-MORTEM (all lanes): the disk root AlgebraicJacobian.lean had drifted BEHIND HEAD by ~14 modules (the DD-4 theta cone + DD-R carve cone) \u2014 every lane was blob-staging root lines (protocol \u00a74b) without applying them to disk, so 'lake build' green was verifying a SUBSET of HEAD. This masked two I-0190-style same-day duplicate coinages that made HEAD red at import join since 13:29: DivisorAdaptation.toOvlLeft_mk/toOvlRight_mk (DivisorFamilyPullbackCert 2de2f76ef vs DivisorFamilyTheta b3ba0b420) and flat_sections_basicOpen (SectionsToDivisors vs DivSchemeFamilySide 003f1e9f8). Both deduped in db5b59fb3 by private-marking the copy without external consumers (Cert's and SectionsToDivisors' respectively). NOTE for DAT-A: flat_sections_basicOpen was a designed SectionsToDivisors deliverable \u2014 its public home is now DivSchemeFamilySide (binder order hV hflat f); reconcile ownership when convenient. LESSONS, binding: (a) after blob-staging a root line, ALSO apply your line to the disk root (it is reconciled to HEAD as of 8f657e777 \u2014 keep it that way); (b) I-0190 lesson 2 is not being followed \u2014 post-commit acceptance MUST include one full root lake build under the mutex; per-file lake env lean cannot catch cross-file duplicates; (c) grep HEAD before coining mirror names (both collisions were foreseeable by a name grep).",
