n the nose. Both stay over a GENERAL field K of the tower (towers are HYPOTHESES), so cheap leaf builds \u2014 the residue-field synthesis only bites when K := \u03ba(p) is instantiated. Threaded unit = u\u2080 \u00b7 thetaFieldShiftUnit\u207b\u00b9 (germ-bridge unit corrected by the \u03a6 shift unit).\n\n=== KEYSTONES (VERBATIM; ns AlgebraicGeometry.ThetaGeneratorSeed) ===\n(1) exists_unit_map_germGenericLinear_range_chartReadMap_relThetaWindowEquiv (vars {k}[Field k](C)(K)[Field K][Algebra k K](\u03c0)[IsFinite \u03c0][IsDominant \u03c0] base+relCurve-C-K Smooth/QC/LFT/IsIntegral inst; (a)) (b : Bool)(h\u03b7V : genericPoint (relCurve C K) \u2208 relPinnedChart C K \u03c0 b)(hH1 : Subsingleton (relTwistPair C k \u03c0 (relThetaCocycle C k \u03c0 a)).H1)(W : Submodule K (K \u2297[k] \u21a5(divisorSections k (a \u2022 fiberWeilDivisor \u03c0) \u22a4))) : \u2203 u : (relCurve C K).functionField\u02e3, Submodule.map (germGenericLinear K h\u03b7V) (LinearMap.range (chartReadMap (Submodule.map (relThetaWindowEquiv C K \u03c0 a hH1).toLinearMap W) b)) = Submodule.map (mulLinear K \u2191u) (Submodule.map (divFamPhi C K \u03c0 a hH1) W)\n    \u2014 THE \u03a6-FORM GERM BRIDGE. Proof: exists_unit_map_germGenericLinear_range_chartReadMap (I-0296) + Submodule.map_comp folding thetaFieldRead\u2218relThetaWindowEquiv + divFamPhi def + a units 'group' identity. maxHeartbeats 800000.\n(2) map_divFamPhi_divUniversalFibreSeedW (seed vars: full campaign context C[Smooth/Proper/GeomIrred]h\u03c0,g,r\u2081,r\u2082,b\u2081,b\u2082,i,j,K with the PairChart/DivCarve towers) : Submodule.map (divFamPhi C K \u03c0 (windowM_choice \u03c0 h\u03c0 g) (relThetaPairH1_windowM C \u03c0 h\u03c0 g)) (divUniversalFibreSeedW \u2026) = divUniversalFibreKM C h\u03c0 g r\u2081 r\u2082 b\u2081 i j K   where divUniversalFibreSeedW := Submodule.span K (windowCompare R_Z K '' divUniversalFstWindow.toSubmodule). Proof: Submodule.map_span + Set.image_comp + divUniversalFibreKM_eq_span. maxHeartbeats 1M, maxR