      "body": "hdiv_seedUniv (hfield core) BUILD \u2014 germ-bridge + fibre-divisibility reduction LANDED (2 sub-bricks); hdiv_seedUniv itself NOT landed (honest BPF/achiever wall, precisely isolated).\n\nNew file Picard/DivSchemeUnivFibreHdiv.lean (230 L). Single-module lake build GREEN (8786 jobs, LEAN_NUM_THREADS=1); both keystones lean_verify axiom-clean [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]; zero sorries; warning-free. Root-wired HEAD-blob + own line only (sibling PicEtCrossBaseGraph add + Hinj removal NOT swept).\n\n=== COMMIT (this lane) ===\n- 15d9eb465  piece-reading germ bridge + fibre divisibility reduction (new file 230 L + root line)\n\n=== KEYSTONES (VERBATIM, ns AlgebraicGeometry; vars {k} C K [Field K] \u03c0 a + [IsIntegral (relCurve C K)] [Smooth 1] [QC]) ===\n(1) germ_relThetaResSide_dvd_iff_ord_le (s t : relThetaSections C K \u03c0 a) (b : Bool) {V} (hV : V <= relPinnedChart C K \u03c0 b) {z} (hzV : z in V) (hzg : z != genericPoint (relCurve C K)) :\n      germ V z hzV (relThetaResSide a b hV t) DVD germ V z hzV (relThetaResSide a b hV s)\n        <-> Scheme.ord (relCurve C K -> Spec K) hzg (thetaFieldRead C K \u03c0 a s) <= Scheme.ord ... hzg (thetaFieldRead C K \u03c0 a t)\n    \u2014 THE GERM BRIDGE (I-0284 first sub-brick): piece side-component germ = thetaFieldRead in dvd form; chart-transition unit (theta cocycle) + trivializing elem_z BOTH cancel in the dvd. Helpers algebraMap_germ_thetaFieldGluedEquiv_eq, exists_unit_germ_relThetaResSide_eq.\n(2) relThetaResSide_mem_span_of_forall_ord_le (s t) (b) (h : \u0393(relCurve C K, relPinnedChart C K \u03c0 b)) (hE : rel a b (basicOpen_le h) t in nonZeroDivisors \u0393(D(h))) (hle : forall w != \u03b7 in D(h), ord(thetaFieldRead s) <= ord(thetaFieldRead t)) :\n      rel a b (basicOpen_le h) s in Ideal.span {rel a b (basicOpen_le h) t}\n    \u2014 THE REDUCTION: piece-ring dvd from pointwise order, via Scheme.mem_span_singleton_of_forall_germ (DivisorStalkIdeal:79) + germ bridge at closed pts + unit at \u03b7 (functionField field). hE germ-regularity: IsAffineOpen.germ_mem_nonZeroDivisors (SectionsToDivisors:98, y EXPLICIT \u2014 NOT the DiagonalChart:126 y-implicit dup).\n\n=== WIRING to hdiv_seedUniv (K=\u03ba(p), D=seedUniv) ===\n\u03c8 in divUniversalSeedK => \u03c8 = relThetaWindowEquiv_{R_Z} x_\u03c8 (x_\u03c8 in divUniversalFstWindow). Brick pinnedPieceSectionsMap_relThetaResSide_windowEquiv rewrites reading(\u03c8), reading(eqn) into rel a b (basicOpen_le h') (\u0398_\u03ba(p)(windowCompare x_\u03c8 / x_sec)), h'=relPinnedSectionsMap \u03ba(p) b (D.h z). Feed reduction with s:=\u0398(windowCompare x_\u03c8), t:=\u0398(windowCompare x_sec). Then seedUniv.hfield_of_forall_pinnedPieceSectionsMap_mem hdiv_seedUniv (KerSpan:147). Residual = 2 hyps of the reduction:\n  (hE) reading(eqn) piece-nonzerodivisor: from thetaFieldRead(\u0398 x_sec)!=0 + integral. CHEAP.\n  (hle) THE WALL: ord(read \u0398 x_\u03c8) <= ord(read \u0398 x_sec) at every closed w in D(h'). shiftUnit cancels => equiv ord(divFamPhi x_\u03c8) <= ord(divFamPhi x_sec). Upper: divFamPhi(windowCompare x_\u03c8) in divUniversalFibreKM = H\u2070(windowN \u2212 d_p) (divFamPhi_windowCompare_mem Res:423 + divUniversalSeedFibreDivisor_spec Fields:146) => ord <= divisorBound(windowN \u2212 d_p)_w ALL w. Lower (WALL): ord(divFamPhi x_sec)_w = divisorBound(windowN\u2212d_p)_w for w in D(h') = seed section reading ACHIEVES d_p on the fibre piece / its extra zeros AVOID D(h'). seedUniv.sec is NOT the global achiever; intended lever = no-leak notMem_of_basicOpen_relPinnedSectionsMap_algebraMap_ne_bot (Facts:258, PRIVATE \u2014 re-export/re-derive) giving f !in p, but the fibre-piece section-zero-avoidance is not yet bridged from it. The XL BPF/achiever content of I-0282/I-0284; reduction now isolates it to this ONE pointwise ord inequality.\n\n=== STATE ===\nGerm bridge + reduction GENERIC over any field K \u2014 reusable for BOTH cores (hinj can consume the germ bridge). hcolFin still open (I-0283). Full-root GREEN. No sorries.",
