      "body": "DD-1c (f) field-dictionary lane \u2014 PARTIAL LANDING (2026-07-17, Opus prover), follow-on to I-0167. File Picard/DivisorFamilyField.lean (169 lines, green, axiom-clean). Commits 86d249f92 (forward+effectivity), 5adba2564 (field half of degree).\n\nLANDED (per I-0167 machinery map):\n- forward map divFamDivisor + keystone presentationDivisor_eq_of_divEq (DivEq-invariance, the finer separate lemma I-0167 flagged) + coeffAt_divFamDivisor.\n- effectivity zero_le_divFamDivisor via ord_algebraMap_stalk_le_one + ord_val_eq_ordZ (I-0167's per-point toAdd(ordZ)>=0, DID NOT need the Dedekind-chart reduction after all \u2014 the germ_generic_eq_algebraMap_germ + valuation_le_one route is shorter).\n- DivisorAdaptation.IsCertified.finrank_glued: certificate over field => finrank K W(d) = n (rankAtStalk_eq_finrank_of_free + Free.of_divisionRing). This is the FIELD half of degree=n.\n\nTHE WALL (I-0167 step iii, geometric half): deg K (presentationDivisor) = finrank K W(d). I-0167 pointed at finrank_quotient_span_section (ChartColength:411) + 'support-splitting CRT across the equalizer'. Confirmed shape: finrank_quotient_span_section gives PER-CHART colength = Sum toAdd(ordZ)*residueDeg (single affine chart V containing eta + single equation f). But W(d) is the EQUALIZER over m0+m1 basic-open pieces; bridging needs 'equalizer of Gamma over cover = global sections of structure sheaf O_D' + finrank(O_D)=deg. The codebase's GluedDivisorSheaf/gluedDivisorSheafIso and W6Full handle the LINE BUNDLE O(D) (its H0 = Riemann-Roch space), NOT the STRUCTURE sheaf O_D of the finite subscheme. So the CRT/Mayer-Vietoris for the structure sheaf is genuinely new infrastructure (XL). RECOMMEND: next lane build (1) O_D structure-sheaf equalizer<->finrank identity per chart via finrank_quotient_span_section, (2) Mayer-Vietoris finrank additivity across the 2-chart cover with overlap correction (support-separated case first: W = Prod colength, no correction \u2014 this also unlocks backward map iv).\n\nBLOCKED on the same wall: (iv) backward map (pointEquations products + support-separating adaptation \u2014 certificate rankAtStalk=n needs finrank(W)=deg even when W=Prod colength) and (v) inverse laws (RefinementInjectivity pattern). Full divFamFieldEquiv assembles only after the geometric half. I-0167 KEPT OPEN (still the machinery map for iv/v).",
