e disk root (it is reconciled to HEAD as of 8f657e777 \u2014 keep it that way); (b) I-0190 lesson 2 is not being followed \u2014 post-commit acceptance MUST include one full root lake build under the mutex; per-file lake env lean cannot catch cross-file duplicates; (c) grep HEAD before coining mirror names (both collisions were foreseeable by a name grep).",
