      "body": "hinj_chart carve rank-g BUILD \u2014 chart-level h z-FREE plumbing LANDED; the carve pin proper (hinj_chart itself) NOT landed (the genuine XL wall unchanged: the SlicingFlatKernel corank-g pin needs the function-field Riemann-Roch count via divUniversalFibreKM + the residue-field k-tower wiring, an instance-explosion minefield per I-0255).\n\nNew file Picard/DivSchemeRedesignHinjChart.lean (237 L). Single-module LEAN_NUM_THREADS=1 lake build GREEN under the mkdir lock (8787 jobs, my module 13s). All 3 keystones lean_verify axiom-clean [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]; zero sorries; zero new warnings (the maxHeartbeat/setOption warnings are pre-existing in GluedSheafH0BaseChange/DivSchemeFamilyUniv/DivisorFamilyThetaSections). Full-root stays GREEN (leaf file). Root: HEAD-blob + only my line (protocol s4 \u2014 sibling PicEtCrossBaseGraph add + Hinj/Achiever/FibreCut/Seed removals in working tree NOT swept; show --stat = my 2 paths, root +1).\n\n=== COMMIT (this lane) ===\n- 895d7d8aa  DD-4 hinj_chart: chart-level carve-pin plumbing \u2014 colength base-change transport + hsub<=>hinj at the chart reading map (h z-free)\n\n=== KEYSTONES (VERBATIM; namespace AlgebraicGeometry.ThetaGeneratorSeed) ===\n\n(1) THE chart-level colength base-change transport (whole chart V, le_rfl; whole-chart analogue of pinnedPieceQuotBaseChangeAlg, built on relTermBaseChangeAlg, NO basic-open localization):\n  relPinnedQuotBaseChangeAlg (C R R' pi)(b : Bool)(E : Set Gamma(relCurve C R, relPinnedChart C R pi b)) : R' (X)[R] (Gamma(relCurve C R, relPinnedChart C R pi b) / Ideal.span E) =A[R'] Gamma(relCurve C R', relPinnedChart C R' pi b) / Ideal.span (relPinnedSectionsMap C R R' pi b '' E)\n  + relPinnedTermBaseChangeAlg / _one_tmul (1(X)s |-> relPinnedSectionsMap s) / relPinnedQuotBaseChangeAlg_one_tmul_mk\n  + mk_tmul_one_eq_zero_iff_relPinnedSectionsMap_mem (b)(E)(s) : ([s] (X)t 1 = 0) <=> relPinnedSectionsMap s in Ideal.span (relPinnedSectionsMap '' E) \u2014 the