      "body": "W7-A1 PARTIAL (lane w7-a1, Opus 4.8, commit ea4ed5c97): datum-level baseChange_ofCurve REDUCED to a single Leg-4 core, not yet fully landed. New Picard/JacobianDataBaseChangeAbel.lean (166L, axiom-clean [propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound], root-wired).\n\nR-K1-3 ACCESSOR RE-PIN (verified vs B-6b committed sig e30e066a1): the worksheet's .hom.hom.hom is CORRECT. baseChangeIsoOfData d dL : (baseChange k L).mapGrp.obj (.mk d.J) \u2245 .mk dL.J in Grp(Over(Spec L)); underlying scheme morphism (baseChange k L).obj d.J \u27f6 dL.J is .hom.hom.hom (iso .hom -> Grp-mor, Mon-mor .hom, underlying .hom). L is IMPLICIT (from dL). Bridge lemma landed:\n  baseChangeIsoOfData_hom_hom_hom : (baseChangeIsoOfData d dL).hom.hom.hom = ((d.baseChange L).uniqueUpToIso dL).hom\nREUSABLE by DAT-J: the equation reducing the frozen baseChangeIso to uniqueUpToIso.\n\nFULL REDUCTION LANDED (baseChange_ofCurve_data_of_core, axiom-clean, modulo hCore): dL.homEquiv injectivity -> accessor bridge -> homEquiv_uniqueUpToIso_hom -> (d.baseChange L).homEquiv unfolds DEFEQ (rfl) to (pic0CrossBaseEquiv...).symm \u2218 d.homEquiv \u2218 (mapPullbackAdj \u03c3 transpose); transpose of (baseChange k L).map aj = (counit.app C) \u226b aj by counit_naturality; homEquiv_comp -> pic0Map C \u03b5C (abelElement C P). Seam crossings term-mode only.\n\nREMAINING = hCore (ONLY gap), Leg-4 '\u03b8 carries the Abel class across the base-field shuffle':\n  (pic0CrossBaseEquiv k L C C_L).symm (pic0Map C ((Over.mapPullbackAdj (Spec.map (CommRingCat.ofHom (algebraMap k L)))).counit.app C) (abelElement C P)) = abelElement C_L (Functor.LaxMonoidal.\u03b5 (baseChange k L) \u226b (baseChange k L).map P)\nUnderlying picEt (Subtype.ext + pic0CrossBaseEquiv_symm_apply_coe + pic0Map_coe + abelElement_coe + abelPicEt_map):\n  picEtCrossBase k L C C_L (picEtMap C \u03b5C (abelPicEt C P)) = abelPicEt C_L Q,  Q = \u03b5 \u226b (baseChange k L).map P.\nCONFIRMED no existing picEtCrossBase\u2194relPicToPicEt/relPicMk b