(hfg : Exact f g) (hf : Injective (f.lTensor kappa)) : Module.Flat R Q. Proof: range f f.g. -> sits in a finite free direct summand F (exists_finite_free_summand_of_fg) -> f factors through F -> mathlib IsLocalRing.split_injective_iff_lTensor_residueField_injective on M->F gives a split -> f split-injective into free N -> N/range f is a retract of N (Module.Flat.of_retract) -> transport Q = N/range f.\n\n(REUSABLE INFRASTRUCTURE) exists_finite_free_summand_of_fg {R M} [Module.Free R M] {L : Submodule R M} (hL : L.FG) : exists (F : Submodule R M) (pr : M ->l F), Module.Finite R F AND Module.Free R F AND L <= F AND pr comp F.subtype = id. \u2014 an f.g. submodule of a free module sits in a finite free direct summand with an explicit retraction (basis-coordinate projection). The mathematical content surviving the loss of finiteness of N.\n(re-derived private helpers residueFieldLocEquiv / residueFieldLocEquiv_map / injective_lTensor_residueField_localizedMap \u2014 the local-splitting fibre-transport core of SlicingFlatKernel re-derived in the NEW file so usable with [Module.Free] not [Module.Finite]; the landed SlicingFlatKernel.lean was NOT touched.)\n\n(THE CHART DELIVERABLE \u2014 Picard/DivSchemeRedesignFreeFlatChart.lean, ns AlgebraicGeometry.ThetaGeneratorSeed)\ntheorem forall_flat_colength_quotient_of_hsub_free (K : Submodule R (relThetaSections C R pi a)) (b : Bool) [Module.Finite R K] (hsub_chart : forall p : PrimeSpectrum R, Function.Injective ((LinearMap.range (chartReadMap K b)).subtype.rTensor p.asIdeal.ResidueField)) : Module.Flat R (Gamma(relCurve C R, relPinnedChart C R pi b) / LinearMap.range (chartReadMap K b)). \u2014 the CHART-level analogue of JFlat forall_flat_colength_quotient_of_hsub, consuming the LANDED hsub_chart (HsubChartPin, I-0299) VERBATIM. Applies the free keystone to (range (chartReadMap K b)).subtype: its range is N_V (Submodule.range_subtype), its residue-fibre injectivity IS hsub_chart. Free codomain via free_sections_relPinnedChart (Free companion of flat_sections_relPinnedChart).\n\n=== ANTI-CIRCULARITY (preserved) ===\nCertificate-FREE, h z-FREE, le_rfl. Pure-algebra criterion consumes NO project geometry (mathlib-only imports). Chart deliverable consumes only chartReadMap + hsub_chart; NO IsGenerator/IsCertified/RD-N/seedUniv'. Preserves I-0289 order: hsub_chart (landed) -> h\u03b7 (landed) -> flat (LANDED HERE, chart level) -> RD-N -> seedUniv' -> certificate -> U1.\n\n=== RESIDUAL toward RD-N ===\n1. PIECE-level hflat: localize forall_flat_colength_quotient_of_hsub_free (chart level, V, le_rfl) to D(h z) subset V AFTER h z chosen, giving the piece-level Module.Flat R ((Gamma(D(h z))/(eqn z)) / N z) that RD-N consumes (I-0299 residual 2). NOW UNBLOCKED \u2014 the flat criterion no longer needs [Module.Finite] on the codomain.\n2. hsub_chart still threaded on hchi (genus chi=1-g, campaign-provided) and h\u03b7 (landed I-0300); once hchi supplied, hsub_chart is unconditional so forall_flat_colength_quotient_of_hsub_free fires.\nThen RD-N -> FibreCut -> ann-cutter -> seedUniv'.IsGenerator -> certificate -> U1 -> divRep.",
