ance keyed on (C\u2297overSpec k L).left does NOT auto-give IrreducibleSpace of relCurve C L \u2014 restate the instance on relCurve C L.\n\n(REUSABLE) surjective_fst_left_overSpec (C) (L : Type u) [Field L] [Algebra k L] : Surjective (fst C (overSpec k L)).left \u2014 first-projection twin of Over.surjective_snd_left (Separatedness:200). = MorphismProperty.of_isPullback (P := @Surjective) (Over.isPullback_left C (overSpec k L)).flip (surjective_specMap_algHom (Algebra.ofId k L)).\n\n=== ANTI-CIRCULAR ORDERING USED ===\nCertificate-FREE, h z-FREE, h\u03c7-threaded. h\u03b7 is pure geometry, consumes NO IsGenerator/IsCertified/flat/seedUniv\u2032. Preserves I-0289 order: hsub_chart (landed) \u2192 h\u03b7 (landed here) \u2192 flat \u2192 RD-N \u2192 seedUniv\u2032 \u2192 certificate \u2192 U1.\n\n=== FLAT-WIRING BLOCKER (step 2) \u2014 PRECISELY CHARACTERIZED (sharpens I-0293 germ-bridge) ===\nJFlat forall_flat_colength_quotient_of_hsub is PIECE-level (D.sideColengthSubmodule z on D.piece z); hsub_chart is CHART-level (range (chartReadMap divUniversalSeedK b) \u2286 \u0393(V); chartReadMap : \u21a5K \u2192\u2097 \u0393(relCurve C R, relPinnedChart C R \u03c0 b), HinjChart:207). Both routes blocked: (A) chart\u2192piece localize (I-0299 resid2) needs h z \u27f9 AFTER RD-N \u27f9 circular. (B) chart-level flat directly (what I-0293 says RD-N needs): the flattening keystones (SlicingFlatKernel c3 Module.Flat.quotient_ker_\u2026 / c4 Module.Flat.quotient_range_\u2026) ALL require [Module.Finite R N] on the CODOMAIN; at chart level N = \u0393(V) is Module.Free R \u0393(V) (flat_sections_relPinnedChart via free_relSections) but INFINITE-rank, NOT finite. Math still holds via N FREE (localization of free is free \u27f9 LocalizedModule N free WITHOUT finiteness, unlike free_of_flat_of_isLocalRing; and range(chartReadMap) \u2245 divUniversalSeedK\u29f8ker is a quotient of the FINITE divUniversalSeedK). NEEDED: free-codomain generalization of Module.Projective.of_forall_rTenso