      "body": "DAT-G0 mountain multisession-deferred \u2014 SIZE VERDICT: NOT a one-session proof (independently confirms I-0263/I-0266/I-0270). Pic0PreservesFilteredBaseColimit is NOT discharged; NO new Lean landed this session (no honest cheap green piece \u2014 the qcqs->affine reduction is itself part of the hard core, and a skeleton would need sorries; sibling critical-path lane RD1 holds context so no risky build attempted). This note re-pins the analytic core as a precise decomposition with goal shapes + avatars so a post-divRep lane can resume cold.\n\n=== IS Pic0PreservesFilteredBaseColimit DISCHARGED? NO. === Unchanged pinned M-L residual in Picard/PicRepColimitCompat.lean (c9df8d479). The delta substrate (PicRepColimitResidual ad6cd964f / PicRepColimitMountain 3c034b6e1) and the reduction are landed; only this theorem remains.\n\n=== WHY MULTI-SESSION (structural, from direct read of the object tower) === Target 'PreservesColimit S.op (pic0TypeFunctor C)' = the canonical map colim_i pic0Subgroup C (S.obj i) -> pic0Subgroup C (lim S) is bijective. pic0TypeFunctor unfolds through a 5-deep tower, EACH layer of which must be spread across the filtered colimit lim S = colim over J\u1d52\u1d56, with ZERO in-tree scaffolding for any spreading:\n - pic0Subgroup C T = {lam \u2208 picEt C T | \u2200 K field/k, \u2200 t:overSpec k K\u27f6T, degAt lam t = 0}  (Pic0Functor.lean:107)\n - picEt C T = picEtSubgroup \u2286 \u03a0 U:T.left.affineOpens, PicEtAff C \u0393(T.left,U), compatible families  (PicEt.lean:91,105)\n - PicEtAff C A = Quotient (\u03a3 E:EtaleCover A, descentClasses C E) mod common refinement  (PicEtAff.lean:198,218)\n - descentClasses C E \u2286 relPic C (overSpec k E.Carrier) with relPicAlgMap(doubleInl)x = relPicAlgMap(doubleInr)x  (PicEtAff.lean:76)\n - relPic C T = (C \u2297 T).left.CechPic \u29f8 picFromBase C T  (RelPic.lean:63); CechPic = Cech H1 (line bundles)\n - EtaleCover A = presented \u00e9tale MvPoly(Fin n)A/ideal, \u00e9tale + Spec-surjective  (Algebra/EtaleCover.lean:64)\n\n=== DECOMPOSED PIN (7 sub-theorems, avatars attached; all divRep-free, ride C/k fp) ===\nM1 \u00c9tale-cover spreading (L): EtaleCover(colim A_i) descends to a finite stage \u2014 fg ideal lifts via MvPolynomial(Fin n) colimit, \u00e9taleness spreads (Algebra.Etale + FinitePresentation limit-stability, NOT a one-liner), Spec-surjectivity spreads. Avatars CommRingCat.preservesColimit_coyoneda_of_finitePresentation (Ring/FinitePresentation.lean:144) + RingHom.EssFiniteType.exists_eq_comp_\u03b9_app_of_isColimit (AffineTransitionLimit.lean).\nM2 Relative-Picard / line-bundle spreading \u2014 THE SUMMIT (XL): spread a Cech Picard class (invertible sheaf) on C\u00d7_k Spec(colim B_i)=colim(C\u00d7_k Spec B_i) mod base to a finite stage; existence+uniqueness of the line bundle. This is the genuine EGA IV.8 Pic-commutes-with-cofiltered-limits theorem, NO in-tree scaffolding. Avatars Scheme.exists_\u03c0_app_comp_eq_of_locallyOfFinitePresentation (AffineTransitionLimit.lean:1177) + exists_hom_hom_comp_eq_comp_of_locallyOfFiniteType (:686), riding LocallyOfFiniteType (relCurve C L \u2198 Spec L) (DivSchemeSeedUnivFields.lean:81).\nM3 Descent-condition spreading (M): the doubleInl/doubleInr equality over E\u2297_A E spreads (rides M2 uniqueness over E\u2297E).\nM4 Plus-quotient bijectivity (L): colim_i PicEtAff C A_i -> PicEtAff C A bijective \u2014 surjective from M1+M2+M3 finite-stage representative; injective from spreading the common refinement (M1) + agreement (M2). Threads the Setoid/common-refinement through the colimit.\nM5 Degree-zero compatibility (M): pic0Subgroup carrier \u2200K field \u2200t, degAt lam t=0 is stage-stable \u2014 field points of Spec(colim A_i) factor through finite stages; degAff base-changes compatibly.\nM6 qcqs->affine reduction (L): the Prop quantifies over ALL qcqs S (affine transition maps), not just affine stages; picEt C (lim S) is the affine-opens limit \u2014 spread each affine open + section of lim S to a finite stage via Scheme.exists_isOpenCover_and_isAffine (:1078) + exists_isAffineOpen_preimage_eq (:1058), reduce to M4.\nM7 Assembly to PreservesColimit (M): wire M4/M5/M6 into IsColimit of the mapped cocone (Types colimit + bijective comparison).\nTotal \u2248 one XL summit (M2) + 3\u00d7L + 3\u00d7M, ~5-10 new files, many hundreds to ~2k lines, several sessions. Recommend defer to post-divRep as planned.\n\n=== VERIFICATION THIS SESSION === All named mathlib avatars confirmed present at cited lines (Ring/FinitePresentation.lean:144; AffineTransitionLimit.lean:686/1058/1078/1177; EssFiniteType in AffineTransitionLimit+Ring/FinitePresentation). fp ride confirmed in-tree (DivSchemeSeedUnivFields.lean:55,81). Confirmed NO existing in-tree colimit/spreading lemma for PicEtAff/relPic/CechPic/EtaleCover (grep) \u2014 nothing shortcuts M2. No files created, no commits, no build (RD1 lock respected).",
